```javascript
const cors = require('cors');
app.use(cors({
  origin: 'https://your-allowed-origin.com', // specify allowed origin
}));
```

### Summary
By implementing these improvements, you can enhance the security and robustness of your application. Make sure to test thoroughly after making these changes to ensure everything works as expected.

